OL,3,GNEWSAExplosive wreck bookings surge
OL,4,Abefore mast removal
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Harmer, who runs X-Pilot tours
OL,7,Fto the SS Richard Montgomery from
OL,8,FQueenborough on the Isle of Sheppey
OL,9,Ftold BBC Radio Kent it is "very spooky
OL,10,Fas you drift past knowing all the
OL,11,Fexplosives are down there".
